{
  "name": "cashwerk – New Booking → Slack + Prep Task",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## New Booking → Team Notification + Task\nWhen someone books an appointment through a cashwerk booking page, notify the team in Slack and create a preparation task in cashwerk.\n\n## Setup\n1. Add your cashwerk API credential.\n2. Connect Slack and choose the channel.\n3. Paste the ID of the board column the prep task should land in into *Create Task* → Task Board Column ID (cashwerk → Tasks → column menu).\n\n_Needs the **cashwerk** community node (`n8n-nodes-cashwerk`) and a cashwerk API key (cashwerk → Settings → API Platform)._",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "n1",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -600,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "events": [
          "booking.create"
        ]
      },
      "id": "n2",
      "name": "cashwerk Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cashwerk.cashwerkTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "",
      "credentials": {
        "cashwerkApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "cashwerk API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "#bookings"
        },
        "text": "=:calendar: *New booking*\n{{ $json.data.inviteeName }} ({{ $json.data.inviteeEmail }})\nStart: {{ $json.data.startAt }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "n3",
      "name": "Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        240,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "apiKey",
        "resource": "taskBoardColumn",
        "operation": "createTask",
        "taskBoardColumnId": "",
        "title": "=Prepare appointment: {{ $json.data.inviteeName }} · {{ $json.data.startAt }}"
      },
      "id": "n4",
      "name": "Create Task",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cashwerk.cashwerk",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        420
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "cashwerkApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "cashwerk API"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "cashwerk Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Slack",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Create Task",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateId": "cashwerk-new-booking-notification",
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "cashwerk"
    },
    {
      "name": "booking"
    },
    {
      "name": "slack"
    }
  ]
}
